{"id":"ab4f4509b9898c69def13d015f5458d21a6c9f20","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239870","title":"我想问下在 windows 下使用 codex 或者 claude code 的人多吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"lingyired","excerpt":"问与答 - @lingyired -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18055042\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e3271ff9902cf6552e437682c6d74442?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jamos\" data-uid=\"192294\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jamos\">jamos</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 23:23:57 +08:00\">20h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>开发不是 win 就是 mac ，ubuntu 等带 gui 的 linux 做开发应该是极少的吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18055051\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b16d/6877/14031_normal.png?m=1693310098\" alt=\"lingyired\" data-uid=\"14031\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lingyired\">lingyired</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 23:30:38 +08:00\">20h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jamos\">jamos</a> 因为 codex 很后期才出的 windows 版本，所以我觉得应该不少人在 wsl 的环境做</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18055238\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3df9/57ba/69588_normal.png?m=1661906159\" alt=\"YAFEIML\" data-uid=\"69588\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YAFEIML\">YAFEIML</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 08:08:59 +08:00\">11h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lingyired\">lingyired</a> codex 桌面端太强了，以至于很多外行加入，可能有些 wsl 都不知道是什么，不过 windows+wsl 确实能省不少事儿，pwsh 还是稍微有些拉。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"2 jamos 20h 43m ago 开发不是 win 就是 mac ，ubuntu 等带 gui 的 linux 做开发应该是极少的吧 3 lingyired OP 20h 37m ago @jamos 因为 codex 很后期才出的 windows 版本，所以我觉得应该不少人在 wsl 的环境做 4 YAFEIML 11h 58m ago @lingyired codex 桌面端太强了，以至于很多外行加入，可能有些 wsl 都不知道是什么，不过 windows+wsl 确实能省不少事儿，pwsh 还是稍微有些拉。","fetched_at":"2026-09-07T12:07:47.796Z","ok":true}